{"logId": "3f03b756-13a8-46e6-a158-e964f959f12f", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——理财", "block_bbox": [311, 121, 733, 163], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[311.0, 121.0], [733.0, 121.0], [733.0, 163.0], [311.0, 163.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "二级【1~2分】：侧重于追求更多的金钱和物质，缺少了对现有生活的体验和享受。（生存阶段）", "block_bbox": [309, 230, 1466, 262], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[309.0, 230.0], [1466.0, 230.0], [1466.0, 262.0], [309.0, 262.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：大多数人的生活状态，偏重于追求物质财富，“小房换大房、大房换别墅，小车换好车、好车换豪车”，不断地盲目追求更高的物质生活水平，把幸福寄托于未来，忽略了目前所拥有的条件和美好，缺少对当下生活的享受和美好体验，但整体来说，没有给个人或家庭造成经济压力、精神困扰。", "block_bbox": [309, 297, 1554, 418], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[309.0, 297.0], [1554.0, 297.0], [1554.0, 418.0], [309.0, 418.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "- 不符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [312, 443, 510, 474], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[312.0, 443.0], [510.0, 443.0], [510.0, 474.0], [312.0, 474.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、经常性超支消费（每月支出达到个人月收入的150%）", "block_bbox": [338, 494, 988, 524], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[338.0, 494.0], [988.0, 494.0], [988.0, 524.0], [338.0, 524.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、与他人相互借款超过年收入的10%", "block_bbox": [337, 538, 781, 567], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[337.0, 538.0], [781.0, 538.0], [781.0, 567.0], [337.0, 567.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、长期对个人或家庭收入状况不满意，认为工资收入低于期望值", "block_bbox": [337, 581, 1094, 610], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[337.0, 581.0], [1094.0, 581.0], [1094.0, 610.0], [337.0, 610.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、认为没有钱或钱不够就不能好好享受生活、休假也玩不开心", "block_bbox": [338, 624, 1066, 653], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[338.0, 624.0], [1066.0, 624.0], [1066.0, 653.0], [338.0, 653.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、经常说“等我有钱了”“努力挣钱是为了以后的幸福”等", "block_bbox": [337, 666, 1043, 697], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[337.0, 666.0], [1043.0, 666.0], [1043.0, 697.0], [337.0, 697.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、为了让家人过上好日子而无奈地选择工作挣钱，总是消极地说没办法、只能这样", "block_bbox": [337, 710, 1304, 740], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[337.0, 710.0], [1304.0, 710.0], [1304.0, 740.0], [337.0, 740.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7、感觉一停下奋斗，就生活紧张", "block_bbox": [339, 753, 728, 783], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[339.0, 753.0], [728.0, 753.0], [728.0, 783.0], [339.0, 783.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "8、攀比别人的生活，羡慕或嫉妒别人有的，贪婪、好高骛远", "block_bbox": [338, 796, 1042, 826], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[338.0, 796.0], [1042.0, 796.0], [1042.0, 826.0], [338.0, 826.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "9、活在荣耀和虚伪的面子里，一定要出人头地、证明给别人看我不差，为了别人的看法而活", "block_bbox": [337, 839, 1409, 870], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[337.0, 839.0], [1409.0, 839.0], [1409.0, 870.0], [337.0, 870.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "10、不懂得知足和感恩，看不到自己所拥有的条件和美好的无知状态", "block_bbox": [339, 882, 1137, 913], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[339.0, 882.0], [1137.0, 882.0], [1137.0, 913.0], [339.0, 913.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[78]", "block_bbox": [916, 968, 956, 993], "block_id": 14, "block_order": null, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[916.0, 968.0], [955.0, 968.0], [955.0, 992.0], [916.0, 992.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8291895389556885, "coordinate": [311, 121, 733, 163], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[311.0, 121.0], [733.0, 121.0], [733.0, 163.0], [311.0, 163.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8723675012588501, "coordinate": [309, 230, 1466, 262], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[309.0, 230.0], [1466.0, 230.0], [1466.0, 262.0], [309.0, 262.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9496840834617615, "coordinate": [309, 297, 1554, 418], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[309.0, 297.0], [1554.0, 297.0], [1554.0, 418.0], [309.0, 418.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.6911272406578064, "coordinate": [312, 443, 510, 474], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[312.0, 443.0], [510.0, 443.0], [510.0, 474.0], [312.0, 474.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8486202955245972, "coordinate": [338, 494, 988, 524], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[338.0, 494.0], [988.0, 494.0], [988.0, 524.0], [338.0, 524.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8438037037849426, "coordinate": [337, 538, 781, 567], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[337.0, 538.0], [781.0, 538.0], [781.0, 567.0], [337.0, 567.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8508196473121643, "coordinate": [337, 581, 1094, 610], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[337.0, 581.0], [1094.0, 581.0], [1094.0, 610.0], [337.0, 610.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8440155982971191, "coordinate": [338, 624, 1066, 653], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[338.0, 624.0], [1066.0, 624.0], [1066.0, 653.0], [338.0, 653.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8420274257659912, "coordinate": [337, 666, 1043, 697], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[337.0, 666.0], [1043.0, 666.0], [1043.0, 697.0], [337.0, 697.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.854110062122345, "coordinate": [337, 710, 1304, 740], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[337.0, 710.0], [1304.0, 710.0], [1304.0, 740.0], [337.0, 740.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8267162442207336, "coordinate": [339, 753, 728, 783], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[339.0, 753.0], [728.0, 753.0], [728.0, 783.0], [339.0, 783.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8549669981002808, "coordinate": [338, 796, 1042, 826], "order": 12, "polygon_points": [[338.0, 796.0], [1042.0, 796.0], [1042.0, 826.0], [338.0, 826.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8680176734924316, "coordinate": [337, 839, 1409, 870], "order": 13, "polygon_points": [[337.0, 839.0], [1409.0, 839.0], [1409.0, 870.0], [337.0, 870.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8462122082710266, "coordinate": [339, 882, 1137, 913], "order": 14, "polygon_points": [[339.0, 882.0], [1137.0, 882.0], [1137.0, 913.0], [339.0, 913.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.7460881471633911, "coordinate": [916, 968, 956, 993], "order": 15, "polygon_points": [[916.0, 968.0], [955.0, 968.0], [955.0, 992.0], [916.0, 992.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 考评奖励标准——理财\n\n## 二 级【1~2分】：侧重于追求更多的金钱和物质，缺少了对现有生活的体验和享受。（生存阶段）\n\n- 本条释义：大多数人的生活状态，偏重于追求物质财富，“小房换大房、大房换别墅，小车换好车、好车换豪车”，不断地盲目追求更高的物质生活水平，把幸福寄托于未来，忽略了目前所拥有的条件和美好，缺少对当下生活的享受和美好体验，但整体来说，没有给个人或家庭造成经济压力、精神困扰。\n\n## - 不符合的行为：\n\n1、经常性超支消费（每月支出达到个人月收入的150%）\n\n2、与他人相互借款超过年收入的10%\n\n3、长期对个人或家庭收入状况不满意，认为工资收入低于期望值\n\n4、认为没有钱或钱不够就不能好好享受生活、休假也玩不开心\n\n5、经常说“等我有钱了”“努力挣钱是为了以后的幸福”等\n\n6、为了让家人过上好日子而无奈地选择工作挣钱，总是消极地说没办法、只能这样\n\n7、感觉一停下奋斗，就生活紧张\n\n8、攀比别人的生活，羡慕或嫉妒别人有的，贪婪、好高骛远\n\n9、活在荣耀和虚伪的面子里，一定要出人头地、证明给别人看我不差，为了别人的看法而活\n\n10、不懂得知足和感恩，看不到自己所拥有的条件和美好的无知状态", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//3f03b756-13a8-46e6-a158-e964f959f12f/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A40%3A11Z%2F-1%2F%2Fa42ab272da593f5f3823aad1de36bfe3cc5c480070c858121696d325a89923b8"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//3f03b756-13a8-46e6-a158-e964f959f12f/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A40%3A11Z%2F-1%2F%2F8dfaac085cfc24e20a7537b7997beb8f2657877280b8bb540ab88b597a8fa73f"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1920, "height": 1080}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//3f03b756-13a8-46e6-a158-e964f959f12f/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A40%3A11Z%2F-1%2F%2F162278a2c23be9b1a3d505a41bf3d193b40afc1ec0e9a4f3df91e7913ff59473"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
